                                      <L-1 L="EN">This container is only required if the stream is consumed by the IEEE1722Tp module and is not an ACF stream. Supported MetaData entries: * IEEE1722TP_COMMON_STREAM_HEADER_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_IEC68133_IIDC_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_IEC68133_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_IEC68133_CIP_NO_SPH_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_IEC68133_CIP_WITH_SPH_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_AAF_PCM_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_AAF_AES3_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_RVF_PTR * IEEE1722TP_RX_CRF_PTR</L-1>
